WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.066
Every season begins with a choice.

00:00:03.066 --> 00:00:04.274
Make yours count.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.480
This is Huddle.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.266
Connect Yahoo.

00:00:08.266 --> 00:00:09.053
Your leagues.

00:00:09.053 --> 00:00:09.840
Your rules.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.019
One command center.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:18.775
As the draft unfolds, compare your best pick,
the safer choice, and the upside play.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.861
Multiple data sources.

00:00:22.861 --> 00:00:23.935
Clear reasoning.

00:00:23.935 --> 00:00:27.156
Rankings built by rules, not guesswork.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:33.230
After draft day, review scores, standings, and
the points left on your bench.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.804
Find the next addition.

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:38.932
Weigh the trade-offs.

00:00:38.932 --> 00:00:40.435
Or hold your ground.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:47.429
Before the clock starts, check draft
readiness, right inside the app.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.693
Huddle reads the field.

00:00:51.693 --> 00:00:53.857
You make every move in Yahoo.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:56.612
Huddle.

00:00:56.612 --> 00:00:57.336
Your league.

00:00:57.336 --> 00:00:58.061
Your call.
